    <title>007.《杀手界》杀手业界的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674c15840ed328720a9c3c23</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674c15840ed328720a9c3c23</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播 大西</span></p><span></span><p><span>前几期都讲到了雇凶杀人，这一期来给大家讲讲杀手</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期给大家分享的书是《杀手界》</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者 伊坂幸太郎</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主要人物介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>铃木：千金的临时工</span></p><span></span><p><span>比与子：千金的职员</span></p><span></span><p><span>寺原：千金的老板</span></p><span></span><p><span>黄与黑：开头被铃木和比与子搬进车的那对男女</span></p><span></span><p><span>鲸：自杀手</span></p><span></span><p><span>梶：议员</span></p><span></span><p><span>蝉：用刀的杀手</span></p><span></span><p><span>岩西：蝉的上司</span></p><span></span><p><span>桃：色情杂志店老板，情报中心</span></p><span></span><p><span>槿：铃木跟踪的男子</span></p><span></span><p><span>堇</span></p><span></span><p><span>健太郎</span></p><span></span><p><span>孝次郎</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容切分】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a>故事开始铃木视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a>鲸出场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a>蝉出场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a>铃木视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a>鲸视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a>蝉视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">40:34</a>鲸视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a>铃木视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2815">46:55</a>鲸与蝉决斗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3207">53:27</a>铃木视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3473">57:53</a>铃木与鲸</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾 Now And Then-The Beatles</span></p>]]></description>
