  <item>
    <title>006.【案件分享】两起离奇的雇凶杀人案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67409e8811045e78e5274a86</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67409e8811045e78e5274a86</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播 大西</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈喽。大家好，上一期给大家讲的是一个类似于雇凶杀人的故事，所以这一期我就找了几个真正雇凶杀人案来给大家聊聊，这几个案子啊也是各有特色。</span><em><span>(舌头上火+鼻炎严重，属于翘舌卷不动舌头，后鼻音也发不出来，大家多担待）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a>案件1开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a>新的突破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a>嫌疑人供述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>新的疑点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a>再一次新的突破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a>真相大白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a>案件2开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a>真相</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>案件1【山东商河县离奇案中案】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>案发现场和一些证据</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhgV6N3Wa_uqJrLB_gmqpGfuDqjb.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-JdVQk3op98xusEDzks6BTjPbt.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuYBIzdDqylymXiQ75rPNVC5Sk-N.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgSq2Dm5f7D7DS2A5fnUH6ZBJTyj.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpile3u4OBatCZljBxq6LXHun1tJ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>相关人物：王希元、韩宝山、韩本立、张本岭、张洪霞、张纯祥</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>案件2 【</span></strong><span>广西杀手套娃案</span><strong><span>】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>相关嫌疑人，覃佑辉，奚广安，莫天祥，杨康生，杨广生，凌显四</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【参考资料】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1、</span><em><strong><span>《今日说法》</span></strong></em><span> 20140810 烟锁殡仪馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、</span><em><strong><span>知乎 </span></strong></em><span>中国最搞笑雇凶杀人案</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ln9-OzfytfjRYHpyxhElUhTRbaKh.m4a" length="36557195" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXLCZce-mcxqdG_vm7XRnq1n3DE.png"/>
